conf\narray in your settings.php file.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Name:        \'job_scheduler_class_\' . $name\nDefault:     \'JobScheduler\'\nDescription: The class to use for managing a particular schedule.</p>\n<h2 class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">Support</h2><a id=\"user-content-support\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: Support\" href=\"#support\"><svg class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"></path></svg></a>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"52572223\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/backdrop/backdrop-issues/issues/487\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/backdrop/backdrop-issues/issues/487/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/backdrop/backdrop-issues/issues/487\">backdrop/backdrop-issues#487</a>\n<a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"98186741\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/backdrop/backdrop-issues/issues/1073\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/backdrop/backdrop-issues/issues/1073/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/backdrop/backdrop-issues/issues/1073\">backdrop/backdrop-issues#1073</a></p>\n<h2 class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">LICENSE</h2><a id=\"user-content-license\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Perma